<title>USA: TABLE-J.C.Penney June same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-J.C.Penney June same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales Summary</p>
<p>			  ($ in millions)</p>
<p>				 Period ended	 Percent increase</p>
<p>			     July 5   July 6	All     Comparative</p>
<p>			     1997	1996	 units   units</p>
<p>5 Weeks</p>
<p>    JCPenney stores    $1,286    $1,262	 +1.9	  +0.8</p>
<p>    Eckerd drugstores     879	 193     +100.0	  +7.9</p>
<p>    Catalog		   265	 256	 +3.4</p>
<p>    Total Company	 2,430     1,711	+42.1</p>
<p>22 Weeks</p>
<p>    JCPenney stores    $5,660    $5,461	 +3.7	  +2.6</p>
<p>    Eckerd drugstores   3,936	 850     +100.0	  +7.7</p>
<p>    Catalog		 1,329     1,295	 +2.6</p>
<p>    Total Company	10,925     7,606	+43.6</p>
<p>	  NOTE: The company's full name is J.C. Penney Co Inc.</p>
